\newlabel{fig:global-infinity}{{3}{23}{Boundary phase portrait for $\kappa >0$. The red great circle $\mathcal E_\infty $ consists of equilibria. Every nonstationary orbit is a great semicircle directed from $p_f^+$ to $p_f^-$. Dashed curves lie on the rear hemisphere. For $\kappa <0$, all arrows reverse}{figure.3}{}}
